            "review_title": "Review at 69 Bach Dang Street",
            "review_text": "holidayseeker\nDerry, United Kingdom3838 contributions\n0\nBasic local restaurant specialising in duck hot pot\nMar 2024 • Couples\nThis restaurant was recommended to us by a local. It specialises in duck . I had a duck hot pot ( soup)it was good but a bit messy to eat. It's really for 2 people but as my husband didn't want it they gave me a half portion It's a very basic local restaurant and very cheap . Staff members were friendly and helpful . The men's toilet was awful a make shift urinal facing the street I didn't chance the Ladies ! They do not take cards and the only alcohol available seems to be beer\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 29, 2024",
