            "review_title": "Review at 69 Bach Dang Street",
            "review_text": "onitada\nWellington, New Zealand321 contributions\n0\nFriendly relaxed place to meet people\nMay 2018 • Solo\nI found this place by mistake and sat down to drink a few Saigon beers in a glass with a ice cube, and then I order the quill wings as well. After that the local people joined me and we drank more beer with a ice cube in a glass. So naturally this became my go to place every night for 6 days. Drinking beer in an glass with a ice cube hanging out with people. On the second to last night I ordered the seafood hot pot, but I forgot that seafood when added to the hotpot should been done at different times and so some of the seafood was overdone stupid me. But I enjoyed it none the less. Drank more beer in a glass with an ice cube in it and made more friends.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 3, 2018",
